<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 100px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">University-Wide Faculty Review</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">Committee Recommendation</h2>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 100px;">
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Promotion</p>
    <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 30px;">CANDIDATE RESPONSE</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 10px;">to</h2>
    <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 10px;">UNIVERSITY-WIDE REVIEW COMMITTEE</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 10px;">RECOMMENDATION</h2>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 100px;">
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Promotion</p>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; color: red; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px;">DELETE THIS PAGE BEFORE FINALIZING YOUR FILE</p>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; color: red; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px;">USE THIS RESPONSE LETTER TEMPLATE IF NOT CREATING YOUR OWN</p>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt; color: red; font-weight: bold;">MAKE SURE TO REMOVE HIGHLIGHTED SECTIONS BEFORE FINALIZING YOUR RESPONSE LETTER.</p>
  </div>
